.TH SNDPLAY 1 "August 13, 1990" "NeXT Computer, Inc."
.SH NAME
sndplay \- play soundfiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sndplay \fIfile\fR ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fISndplay\fR
reads each file in sequence and plays it on the sound-out hardware.
The soundfiles may be of any playable type; 
runtime conversion is performed if possible.  
Emphasized formats are played 
with the low-pass filter activated (if available).
.SH "SEE ALSO"
sndinfo(1), sndrecord(1), sndconvert(1), sndcompress(1)
.SH BUGS
Not all sound formats are playable.
